msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:521
msgid "Two extra buttons that act on the page somebody is looking at rather than taking them somewhere. Save appears on a listing page and needs the Favorites extension; Alert me appears on a search results page and needs the Search Alerts extension. Both are added after your own items, so they cost you none of the five slots, and both open the sign-in pop-up for a logged-out visitor rather than failing."
msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:526
